# Terraform local state & provider binaries
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
provider.tf
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
.terraform.lock.hcl

# Frontend & Node.js build dependencies (keep modules/serenity-core/front/output/ tracked for S3 upload)
**/node_modules/
**/front/app/dist/

# Python virtual environments & caches
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# OS & Logs
*.log
.DS_Store
*:Zone.Identifier
